    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like everything i ever cared about is just... rotting. the town, the people, the way things used to be. it's all just slow decay now. i'm sitting here watching it happen and it just feels pointless. why even bother sticking around to see the very end of it? it's just gonna be wreckage anyway.",
