    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "small acts of beauty? i dont see any anymore. everything just feels like staring into a void. it's like watching a sunset, but the sun is never actually going to come back up. it's just darkness getting closer. if the outcome is already decided, and it's just nothingness in the end... what's the point of enduring the struggle?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
